{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object visible, approach, take, check properties and go to destination. Otherwise, scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <SubTree ID = ObjectPropertiesTask    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    />\"",
